## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily standup

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

Đổi nguồn sang nội dung backend. Gợi ý: kênh của Fireship, hoặc talk của Matteo Collina *(tác giả Fastify và pino)* — giọng Ý nói tiếng Anh, tốt để luyện nghe giọng không bản xứ.

### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. This week I'm starting backend work — Node and Postgres, with the goal of replacing Supabase with an API I write myself.*
> *Today I deliberately built an HTTP server with no framework, just the http module. It's slower to write, but it made a few things concrete: the request body is a stream you have to assemble yourself, nothing sets Content-Type for you, and an uncaught error takes down the whole process rather than one screen.*
> *That last one is the biggest mental shift coming from mobile. On the client a crash affects one user. On the server it affects everyone connected.*
> *I also ran an experiment blocking the event loop for five seconds and watching a second request sit and wait. Same lesson as blocking the JS thread on mobile, but with worse consequences.*
> *Tomorrow: REST design and input validation."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `assemble` (v) | gom lại thành | *You assemble the body from chunks.* |
| `uncaught error` | lỗi chưa bắt | *An uncaught error takes down the process.* |
| `take down` | làm sập | *It takes down the whole process.* |
| `mental shift` | thay đổi cách nghĩ | *That's the biggest mental shift.* |
| `sit and wait` | nằm chờ | *The second request just sits and waits.* |

